| Version   | Changes                                             |
| --------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| `v15.4.0` | `global-not-found.js` introduced (experimental).    |
| `v13.3.0` | Root `app/not-found` handles global unmatched URLs. |
| `v13.0.0` | `not-found` introduced.                             |

